    "title": "Coast To Coast AM Insider",
    "description": "Coast to Coast AM, a nightly radio show hosted by George Noory, explores the world of the paranormal, alternative ideas, and the unexplained. This app offers live and on-demand audio streams, and podcast downloads for the last 90 days of shows for Coast Insider members. \r\n\r\nOur newest feature is the Art Bell Vault which provides access to curated programs, dating back as far as 25 years ago. \r\n\r\nThe app also includes show, article, guest--related information, contact info by phone or email, a radio station list, and a sign-up for the Coastzone newsletter.",
